    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4094" root="تم" body-key="t">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمِيمٌ</span></b>  <i>Strong; firm; hard:</i> (A'Obeyd, T, S,
M, Msb, K:) or <i>strong in make,</i> or <i>formation:</i>
(TA:) or <i>complete,</i> or <i>perfect, in make,</i> or <i>formation, and strong:</i> (M:) applied to a man and to
a horse: (M, TA:) fem. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>. (TA.) See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَامٌّ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Tall;</i> (T;) applied to a man. (TA.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمِيمَةٌ</span>.

